    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρραίνω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έρρᾱνα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sprinkle upon</i> or <i>over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					24.98
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				758a16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποὺς ταῖς κεφαλαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.72
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠὰ τὸν θορόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					567b5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.78
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
