			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸν κατέχριεν ἐπιρραίνων ἑπτάκις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.157
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				756a24
			</span></i>.</div>
